{"id":"abzan-patrol","name":"Abzan patrol","type":"faction","aliases":["the patrol"],"description":"A fifty-strong Abzan patrol that polices the Salt Road and protects shepherds.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2014-11-12","last_seen":"2014-11-12","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Salt Road","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jeremiah Isgur"],"date":"2014-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Salt Road\" by Jeremiah Isgur. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"the-salt-road-e0","era":null,"summary":"Riza and his Abzan patrol of fifty march along the Salt Road, and Riza notes the smoke on the horizon is not a Mardu camp.","participants":["riza","abzan-patrol"],"location":"salt-road","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-salt-road","order":471,"story_date":"2014-11-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":3,"quote":"But that is no Mardu encampment.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=But%20that%20is%20no%20Mardu%20encampment.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Salt Road","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jeremiah Isgur"],"date":"2014-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=But%20that%20is%20no%20Mardu%20encampment.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Salt Road\" by Jeremiah Isgur. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2014."}},{"id":"the-salt-road-e1","era":null,"summary":"The patrol finds a shepherds' summer camp destroyed, with every villager killed, and Riza orders the dead buried, fearing the horde of at least one hundred that did it.","participants":["riza","abzan-patrol",