":null,"summary":"Riza decides against direct confrontation and orders the patrol to fall back to the Canyon Falls oasis to await a larger Salt Road patrol.","participants":["riza","abzan-patrol"],"location":"canyon-falls","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-salt-road","order":471,"story_date":"2014-11-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":27,"quote":"We will fall back to the oasis at Canyon Falls and await the larger Salt Road patrol.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=We%20will%20fall%20back,larger%20Salt%20Road%20patrol.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Salt Road","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jeremiah Isgur"],"date":"2014-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=We%20will%20fall%20back,larger%20Salt%20Road%20patrol.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Salt Road\" by Jeremiah Isgur. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2014."}},{"id":"the-salt-road-e6","era":null,"summary":"The Mardu horde rides through the night; the Abzan spy buzzard reports it is turning to engage and will arrive before noon.","participants":["abzan-patrol","mardu"],"location":"salt-road","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-salt-road","order":471,"story_date":"2014-11-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"The horde has turned south to engage us,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=The%20horde%20has%20turned%20south%20to%20engage%20us%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Salt Road","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jeremiah Isgur"],"date":"2014-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=The%20horde%20has%20turned%20south%20to%20engage%20us%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Salt Road\" by Jeremiah Isgur. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2014."}},{"id":"the-salt-road-e7","era":null,"summary":"Riza settles on retreating to the oasis canyon to nullify the Mardu cavalry advantage, ordering double time.","participants":["riza","abzan-patrol"],"location":"canyon-falls","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-salt-road","order":471,"story_date":"2014-11-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":45,"quote":"Let's give ourselves the best odds.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=Let%27s%20give%20ourselves%20the%20best%20odds.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Salt Road","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jeremiah Isgur"],"date":"2014-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=Let%27s%20give%20ourselves%20the%20best%20odds.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Salt Road\" by Jeremiah Isgur. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2014."}},{"id":"the-salt-road-e9","era":null,"summary":"At the oasis, Riza orders a shield wall, hidden archers, and an ambush, and rallies his soldiers.","participants":["riza","ogan-shieldmender","abzan-patrol"],"location":"canyon-falls","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-salt-road","order":471,"story_date":"2014-11-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"Hide our archers among the boulders along the west rim of the canyon to keep the horde away from that side.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=Hide%20our%20archers%20among,away%20from%20that%20side.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Salt Road","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jeremiah Isgur"],"date":"2014-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=Hide%20our%20archers%20among,away%20from%20that%20side.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Salt Road\" by Jeremiah Isgur. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2014."}},{"id":"the-salt-road-e10","era":null,"summary":"The Mardu horde nears the oasis; the Abzan form a shield wall and endure a barrage of arrows.","participants":["abzan-patrol","mardu"],"location":"canyon-falls","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-salt-road","order":471,"story_date":"2014-11-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"The air hummed with the flight of arrows.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=The%20air%20hummed%20with%20the%20flight%20of%20arrows.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Salt Road","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jeremiah Isgur"],"date":"2014-11-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=The%20air%20hummed%20with%20the%20flight%20of%20arrows.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Salt Road\" by Jeremiah Isgur. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Nov 2014."}},{"id":"the-salt-road-e11","era":null,"summary":"The Mardu horde splits in two to attack both ends of the canyon, and the hordechief glimpses an Abzan siege elephant tower.","participants":["mardu-hordechief","mardu","abzan-patrol"],"location":"canyon-falls","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-salt-road","order":471,"story_date":"2014-11-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":63,"quote":"He rose in his saddle just in time to see the tower of the Abzan siege elephant poking through the haze in the distance…","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-salt-road#:~:text=He%20rose%20in%20his,haze%20in%20the%20dista